[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/issues/33","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/issues/33/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/issues/33/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/issues/33/events","html_url":"https://github.com/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/pull/33","id":5556840655,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTt1shc8AAAABEyk-zg","number":33,"title":"Storefront and admin updates: equal shop cards, FAQ contact block, free-tier swag, ticket-only products, hideable nav tabs","user":{"login":"Joel-Fah","id":69576717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTc2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69576717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah","html_url":"https://github.com/Joel-Fah","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12331482242,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTt1shc8AAAAC3wN8gg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/labels/status:%20in-progress","name":"status: in-progress","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"Being worked on","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12331483503,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTt1shc8AAAAC3wOBbw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/labels/priority:%20medium","name":"priority: medium","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"Important, not urgent","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12331484045,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTt1shc8AAAAC3wODjQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/labels/type:%20feature","name":"type: feature","color":"a2eeef","default":false,"description":"New functionality","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-23T17:11:38Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T17:28:15Z","closed_at":"2026-09-23T17:28:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/pulls/33","html_url":"https://github.com/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/pull/33","diff_url":"https://github.com/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/pull/33.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MENGUEDAVIS/devfest-yaounde/pull/33.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-23T17:28:14Z"},"body":"Five storefront and admin updates, in three commits on top of `main` (which is level with `origin/main` and `upstream/main`).\n\n> **Deploy note:** the navbar switches need `supabase/migrations/0027_nav_tab_visibility.sql` applied before a change can be *saved*. Reading is safe without it (every tab simply shows), and the panel says so if saving fails. It was not applied to any database.\n\n## What changed\n\n- **Shop cards are equal height.** The grid let each card keep its own height; cards now stretch to the tallest in their row with the price pinned to the bottom. Checked on the live catalogue.\n- **\"Didn't find your answer?\" after the FAQs.** A question box pre-filled from the FAQ search (the visitor's own edits win), an optional name, and a button that opens their mail app with a subject and polite message already composed — both languages. Nothing is posted or stored. Also shows after \"no results\".\n- **The free ticket's swag now shows.** The free (`rsvpExternal`) tier's card was a separate branch that never rendered the swag preview, so the attached certificate was invisible. The count label is now a proper plural (\"1 thing in the box\").\n- **Ticket-only products.** A new *Ticket-only* switch on a product: it shows as swag on the tickets that bundle it, but isn't listed in the shop, has no page, isn't in the sitemap, and **cannot be ordered** (checkout prices against the shop view, and `isPurchasable()` refuses it outright). No price or picture needed. A hidden draft still stays off the tickets.\n- **Show/hide navbar tabs.** Config → Navigation switches Schedule, Speakers, FAQs, Team, Shop and Tickets on or off; the language switch always stays. Hides the *link* only — the page still exists.\n- Small fix found on the way: the cart hook's server snapshot returned a fresh `[]` each call, which React warns about in dev.\n\nADR 0070 and the guides are updated.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run verify` — 283 tests, lint and typecheck clean; production build passes from the committed tree.\n- Browser gate suite: 18/18 against that build.\n- In a real browser: equal card heights per row on the live catalogue; the live \"Official Certificate\" on the free tier; FAQ CTA seeding / edit-wins / name in the message; the navbar with none, some and all tabs hidden (language switch always present); the admin Navigation and ticket-only screens.\n\n## Not done here\n\n- Saving a nav change or marking a product ticket-only writes real site data, so those were exercised through the UI and tests but **not persisted** to the live database.\n- Migration 0027 is shipped, not applied.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","closed_by":{"login":"Joel-Fah","id":69576717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTc2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69576717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/us